Original solutions to all three questions of the <University of Oxford> Part A <topology> examination, sat on 25 June 2021. Source: https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/bsc_mathematics_part_a_examinati/response/2820674/attach/3/FOI%20202410%20944%20Data.pdf#page=94[officially released examination PDF, parent PDF pages 94–96; printed paper pages 1–3]. All 25 answer parts are covered, including every alternative. Only the best two questions counted towards the examination mark.

